<<~ ahu slot=`#/5-open-questions-only-the-operator-can-rule`>>

!! 5. Open questions only the operator can rule (each with a lean)

# ''Order versus default.'' Full is ruled the default. As built, it fails the house's own +25 % marginal-memory gate (+240 %) and paints in 33 s cold at 2,000 tiddlers. Does full open first anyway, or does full arrive by ''skinny first paint, then promotion'', until the landing cure passes the gate? ''Lean: promote.'' The law stays "full wherever carried". The order gives a painted surface before the heavy landing and moves an iOS kill to after paint. The port contract gains the widening-open row (§3 YANG). When the landing cure passes the gate, the promotion order retires on that measured reading, not on a date.
# ''The one-tab evidence record'' (`mirror:began` in `sessionStorage`, cleared at first full paint). Is it evidence, or a flag in disguise? ''Lean: permit it.'' It records an event, never a width. It never leaves the tab, and without it Safari's own double reload walks a jetsam device into "A problem repeatedly occurred". Forbid every other stored form.
# ''A person's own choice of a lighter surface.'' The flag is dead, but a human may want "light reading" on a metered phone. That is an //intent//, not a capability. ''Lean: permit it later as a face intent'' (riding <code>&#64;intents-&lt;tag></code>, worded for a person, never `skinny`). It can narrow the width and never widen it past what the lighting measured. Not in D3.
# ''Should the grant carry a width ceiling'' (a vessel's policy lending `widths`)? ''Lean: no.'' Width is the page's capacity and confers no authority (R11); a ceiling on the grant would mix the two again.
# ''Hidden tabs.'' N visible tabs carry N mirrors. Should a tab that stays hidden release its mirror to the none projection? ''Lean: no step-down on hiding'' (hiding is not capacity evidence). Revisit only if the phone measurement shows multi-tab kills, and then as a causal act (`pagehide`), never a timer.
# ''Story width.'' It has stood unmeasured since the spike ran ("story only if skinny and full split"). ''Lean: hold it'' as a wire value with no lighting path, and decide it once promotion lands, since the full/skinny split it waits on may then dissolve.

